{{cit|t|a}}

== Effect ==
* Prevents [[activated collectible]]s from being generated, if possible, from all item pools while this trinket is being held.

== Notes ==
* Activated items will start appearing again once the item pool's non-activated items are exhausted or become scarce.
* When the trinket is dropped, the item generation mechanics go back to normal, and active items will be generated normally again.
* In runs where many items have been collected/rerolled, the trinket can function as a sort of warning to the player that an item pool will soon be exhausted if activated items begin to show up.
* {{dlc|nr}} Fixed boss drops and machines are not affected by '''NO!''':
** {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}} from {{E|Pride}}
** {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}} from {{E|Sloth}}
** {{i|Crystal Ball}} from a {{Machine|Fortune Telling Machine}}
** {{i|Head of Krampus}} from {{E|Krampus}}
** {{i|IV Bag}} from a {{Machine|Blood Donation Machine}}
** {{i|Mr. Boom}} from {{E|Wrath}}
** {{i|A Pony}} from {{E|Headless Horseman}}
** {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}} from {{E|Envy}}
** {{i|White Pony}} from {{E|Conquest}}
** {{i|Yum Heart}} from {{E|Super Lust}}
* {{dlc|r}} Most fixed active item drops are prevented:
** {{E|Pride}} drops a {{E|Key}}
** {{E|Sloth}} drops a [[Cards and Runes#Cards|card]]
** {{E|Krampus}} always drops {{i|A Lump of Coal}}
** {{Machine|Blood Donation Machine}}s drop a {{i|Blood Bag}} if unlocked, still {{i|IV Bag}} otherwise
** {{E|Wrath}} drops {{E|Bomb}}s
** {{E|Headless Horseman}} and {{E|Conquest}} drop either {{i|Ball of Bandages}} or {{i|Cube of Meat}}
** {{E|Envy}} drops a {{E|Troll Bomb}}
** {{E|Super Lust}} drops a [[pill]]
** {{e|Baby Plum}} will spawn a regular [[Boss (Item Pool)|boss room]] item if spared.
* Some active items that are hard-coded to appear in certain rooms will still spawn, such as [[Grave Room]]s that contain {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or {{s|Dross}} rooms that contain {{i|The Poop}}.
* {{e|Bumbino}} will still drop active items from his item pool, if he collects enough coins.
* {{i|Mystery Gift}} can still give {{i|The Poop}}.
* {{e|Shopkeeper}}s can still drop {{i|Coupon}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Items with 0 [[item quality|quality]] are rerolled.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Book of Virtues}}: Will not be prevented from spawning, since it's treated as a passive item. Is nigh-guaranteed to spawn in a {{R|Library}}.
* {{I|Death Certificate}}: Active Items generated in Death Certificate rooms ignore NO!'s changes to item availability.
* {{i|Magic Skin}}: Additional copies of Magic Skin can still replace other items.
* {{I|TMTRAINER}}: Active items generated by TMTRAINER will not be prevented from spawning.

